      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA LET LOOSE (7) looks close to another win after hitting the frame in a 5.5 lengths third (22.54) in a Grade 6 at this track. Likely to feature again. THERMODYNAMIC (4) had been racing well with a Maiden win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. ZAC SURE CAN (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Striking Tide (20.05) in a Grade 6. Worked home well on that occasion and should be strong late. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expected to be in this for a long way. CALYPSO (2) placed last start at big odds and is in the mix again.",
